    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awakening in heaven, its sanctity and splendor remain, yet there are no paths upwards\u2014only stairs leading down. As the descent continues, more and more things appear that do not belong here. Check the blood-stained Bible and take up the shining cross, for ahead lies the mark of the demonic god.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309220/extras/78599cd4a5fb90b13e30e2b2eab9818d.avif?t=1736218261\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Gameplay:</i></strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into a world where heaven is marred by an unsettling invasion. Equip the shining cross to fend off demonic entities and explore the realms below.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Atmosphere:</i></strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a strikingly detailed environment that blends the ethereal with the corrupted. The haunting soundtrack underscores your journey, enhancing every step.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Puzzles &amp; Challenges:</i></strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face intricate puzzles and straightforward challenges as you navigate through the levels. Each challenge you conquer brings you closer to unraveling the mysteries that lie ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309220/extras/9c049f1baee99896528fe3326b4cea74.avif?t=1736218261\" width=720 height=404 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare yourself for a journey that melds the divine with the diabolical. Dive deep into this ethereal yet corrupted realm and emerge victorious, with the shining cross as your beacon of hope.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309220/extras/e98ec0d1d9f2a6e68ee8a1e932c0c083.avif?t=1736218261\" width=720 height=404 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is created by @\u51b7\u5bb8\u8c26 with YAHAHA Horror Game Kit and YAHAHA assists the creator with packaging and publishing the game based on their request. Yahaha Horror Gamekit is tailored for imaginative creators and players who adore horror games, all without the need for any programming expertise.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309220/extras/712ca6f3ce7a34631e02427906a973a8.avif?t=1736218261\" width=720 height=216 /></span></p>",
